  "ingredients": [
    "8 ounce ground chicken",
    "8 ounce ground pork",
    "1/2 cup shredded mozzarella",
    "4 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1 whole chicken bouillon cube (crumbled)",
    "1/2 cup fresh parsley (chopped)",
    "1/2 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "3 tablespoon butter",
    "4 medium zucchini (spiralized)",
    "1/2 medium lemon (juice of )"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-meatballs-with-lemon-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-53925-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Meatballs-Zoodles-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine ground chicken and ground pork, shredded mozzarella, minced garlic, chicken bouillon cube, parsley, and salt and pepper. Stir well to combine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-meatballs-with-lemon-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-53925-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Meatballs-Zoodles-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "With your hands, form this into balls.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-meatballs-with-lemon-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-53925-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Meatballs-Zoodles-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over low to medium heat, add the butter and allow it to melt. Then, add the meatballs and cook thoroughly for about 8 - 10 minutes. Be sure to cook all sides. Once thoroughly cooked, remove from pan and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-meatballs-with-lemon-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-53925-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Meatballs-Zoodles-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same pan, add the juice of lemon and crushed red pepper flakes. Then add the spiralized zucchini to the pan and stir together. Cook the zoodles for about 3 - 5 minutes. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-meatballs-with-lemon-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-53925-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Meatballs-Zoodles-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the frying pan is still on the stovetop, add the meatballs back into the pan, staying on one side of the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-meatballs-with-lemon-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-53925-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Meatballs-Zoodles-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with lemon slices.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-meatballs-with-lemon-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-53925-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Meatballs-Zoodles-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-meatballs-with-lemon-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-53925-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
